  'slot.comms.why.short': 'A Mission only counts if its Data gets home. A weak antenna loses some of it.',
  'slot.pointing.why.short': 'Spinning like a top keeps it steady. Explorer 1 spun 750 times a minute.',
  'slot.propulsion.why.short': 'To climb higher than the rocket takes it, the Spacecraft needs an engine of its own.',
  'slot.payload.why.short': 'The Payload is why you fly: a detector, a camera or a radio relay.',
